meta {
  name: Payment Webhook (reference only)
  type: http
  seq: 8
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/webhooks/payment
  body: text
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  stripe-signature: t=1234567890,v1=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
}

body:text {
  {
    "id": "evt_test_xxxxxxxxxx",
    "type": "payment_intent.succeeded",
    "data": {
      "object": {
        "id": "pi_test_xxxxxxxxxx",
        "metadata": {
          "orderId": "clxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}

docs {
  ## POST /api/webhooks/payment  ⚠️ Do NOT call manually

  Stripe webhook for **order payment** events (separate from subscription billing).
  Handles `payment_intent.succeeded` → marks order as `CONFIRMED`.
  Also handles `payment_intent.payment_failed` → marks order as `PAYMENT_FAILED`.

  Like the billing webhook, verifies the Stripe signature before any action.

  > **Testing:** Use `stripe listen --forward-to localhost:3000/api/webhooks/payment`
}
